# power_arch1 — Python execution provenance (uv)

All study scripts in this directory execute under `uv` from the parent
checkout root (`/Users/dwinkelman/Code/baboon-test`, which owns
`pyproject.toml` / `uv.lock` / `.venv`). Do NOT run them with bare
`python3` / `python`; always use `uv run --project <checkout-root> python ...`
so the locked interpreter + environment apply. The toolchain fixes
(`BaboonTranslator`, `FnDepGraphBuilder`) are untouched by this change.

## Toolchain

- `uv 0.7.19 (38ee6ec80 2025-07-02)`
- `Python 3.13.5` (via `uv run --project /Users/dwinkelman/Code/baboon-test python --version`; `.python-version` pins `3.13`)
- `.venv` already existed at the checkout root, so it was NOT recreated.
  `uv venv` was unnecessary; the environment was ensured non-destructively with:

```sh
uv sync --project /Users/dwinkelman/Code/baboon-test
# Resolved 8 packages ... Audited 7 packages (no changes needed)
```

## Exact commands (run from the checkout root `/Users/dwinkelman/Code/baboon-test`)

```sh
uv run --project /Users/dwinkelman/Code/baboon-test python --version
uv run --project /Users/dwinkelman/Code/baboon-test python baboon/studies/power_arch1/study_golden.py
uv run --project /Users/dwinkelman/Code/baboon-test python baboon/studies/power_arch1/study_freq_sweep.py
uv run --project /Users/dwinkelman/Code/baboon-test python baboon/studies/power_arch1/study_cores_plus1.py
uv run --project /Users/dwinkelman/Code/baboon-test python baboon/studies/power_arch1/study_derate.py
```

(`python <relative path>` works because Python puts the script's own
directory first on `sys.path`, so `import power_model` / `import study_common`
resolve; outputs are written next to the scripts via `study_common.emit`.)

Optional differential check (also under uv, same pattern):

```sh
uv run --project /Users/dwinkelman/Code/baboon-test python baboon/studies/power_arch1/run_codegen_check.py
```

